  "body": "This is an issue present in the test case logic. The `col_values` helper in tests/pkg_parse.rs decodes `flatroot query` incorrectly:\n\n```rust\nfn col_values(rows: &[String], col: &str) -> Vec<String> {\n  let needle = format!(\".{col}=\");\n  rows.iter().filter(|l| l.starts_with(\"query.\"))\n      .filter_map(|l| l.split_once(&needle).map(|(_, v)| v.to_string())).collect()\n}\n```\n\nThe expected shape for this format is:\n\n```\nquery.0.name=bash\nquery.0.version=5.2\n```\n\nThe actual shape is:\n\n```\nquery.0.cells.0.column=name\nquery.0.cells.0.value=bash\nquery.0.cells.1.column=version\nquery.0.cells.1.value=5.2\n```",
